DESCRIPTION:German National Day\, marks the reunification of Germany in 199
 0 after more than four decades of division. It commemorates the peaceful p
 ath to unity that followed the fall of the Berlin Wall and remains Germany
 ’s most important national celebration. In Brisbane\, iconic landmarks w
 ill shine in the German colours black red and gold to mark the occasion. P
 lease note: This event is part of Brisbane German Week. For more informati
 on\, please visit Brisbane German Week Website . This event is proudly sup
 ported by Brisbane City Council.
